{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"﻿﻿\nこんばんは〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう8月です。無事に夏休みに入りました！\nとても暑いです🫠"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日発表されました、\n『W-KEYAKI FES. 2022』の振替公演が決定致しました〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後をLIVEで皆さんと一緒に過ごせることがとてもありがたく、とても嬉しく、\n今回のために動いてくださった皆様に感謝の気持ちでいっぱいです。ありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様お忙しいとは思いますが、\nスケジュール調整など無理ない程度にしていただいて\n共に楽しい時間を過ごすことができたら嬉しいです☺️✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グッズやフードなども是非〜🥕🦖　振替公演に関してはこちらをhttps://sakurazaka46.com/s/s46/news/detail/E00127?ima=4106"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"催事に関してはこちらをhttps://sakurazaka46.com/s/s46/news/detail/M00538?ima=4106　ご覧ください🙇‍♀️✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全員でこの二日間を無事に終えられるよう引き続き、体調管理も気を付けたいと思います。\nみなさまもお気をつけください〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0XYG5V4TBF60XXCH4YEEQQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0XYHE71F2HK87ZKXMX5HDQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n　　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0XYJD6ZPGTXTQ1TFGSZWH1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近もらった花束🌻"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0XYKM3737207Y9EC430JAM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">　わたしいつまで誕生日なの、　　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0XYMM5PFJNTABW9MZFN6VD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">　🫶　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0XYNKZD627S6SH0GD35RMW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n　✌️\nちょっと前のお気に入りの写真たち、いつどこで載せようか迷っているうちに載せそびれていたのでいま載せます😎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたいことにブログもメッセージも延長していただきましたので、\n8月もお付き合いください〜🥺"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あおい"}],"source":"archive"}